### Page 6 of 7

```text
P a g e | 2

EZ Liner would like to thank you for the opportunity to quote the update your timing and control equipment
to sustain the efficient, reliable EZ Liner striping truck that you expect from us at EZ Liner.
EZ Liner is the sole source manufacturer and service provider of your striping unit. We are fully capable of
furnishing all labor, material, and equipment necessary to recondition or refurbish the painting equipment
and electronics with new technology to efficiently operate the unit in today’s striping environment. There is
no other company more qualified to work on your striping truck. In this process your truck will be going
through different phases of inspections, updates and replacements that will make it more efficient and
become more user friendly. After completing the work your timing and control equipment should be in
great working order for many years to come.

Our Proposal:

Replacing carriage bushings

Replacing wear pads on outriggers

Inspecting cylinders

Charge the a/c

Replacing gauges that are broken, leaking or not working
On hydraulic system we will be inspecting all the hose’s along with;

Hydraulic pump

Agitator motors

Cooler

Replacing filters, and oil

Removal of EZSteer and installation of hydraulic steering from center counsel
Air system will have the all the air hoses inspected along with;

Replacing the air solenoids on the carriages

Replace air dryer

Inspect the compressor and servicing
Bead system;

Replace all bead tank hoses

Re-kit bead guns
Paint system;

Replace all high-pressure paint hoses

Rebuild high-pressure pumps

Rebuild low-pressure pumps

Add proximity stroke counters to paint pumps

Rebuild paint guns

Inspect and clean paint heat system

Clean Paint tanks and re-graphite
Electrical system;

Inspecting electrical system

Re-wiring to the carts

Testing all electrical
```

